    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "And I guess a lot of people have a question. And I guess I'll let you, I don't know how much you want to give away of what you all are going to do then. But there's concern that, of course, if the Democrats do not secure the House that this will be over and done with by the end of, you know, before the next Congress is seated, and that nothing will actually come from this. And there's still a concern about linking Donald Trump directly to the insurrection. What are your thoughts on that?",
