    "turn_text": "That's so right. And that's sort of a sad passage for me because my son Tommy also used to talk about that and talked about Nietzsche saying that politics is just worse. and fraud and the will to power. And Tom Payne was saying, no, it doesn't have to be that way. We can see it with our eyes. We can recognize fraud. We can recognize tyrants like Donald Trump and Vladimir Putin. And so that's the struggle that we're in today, Brian. It's the struggle to get people to wake up to the truth. And that's it. And the struggle for the truth is the struggle for democracy. It's the same thing.",
