    "turn_text": "Well, I'm concerned that democracies under siege all over the world and the autocrats and the kleptocrats and the theocrats are on the march, whether you're talking about the theocratic thugs who run Iran or Saudi Arabia or the autocrats who with Vladimir Putin run Russia. with the oligarchs there and their imperialist filthy bloodthirsty war against the people of Ukraine, which now the people of Ukraine are winning, thanks to President Biden and our determination to support democratic forces, no thanks to the Matt Gaetz's and Marjorie Taylor, Greens and Lauren Boberks of the world, who are key leaders for Vladimir Putin. You know, but democracy is under siege everywhere you turn from Moscow to Mar-a-Lago and they are all rooting for Donald Trump and for the defeat of democracy in America because they understand that it is our historic assignment. to stand up for human rights and for political freedom. Tom Payne said that America would become an asylum to humanity, not an insane asylum, mind you, but a place of refuge for people fleeing from political and religious and economic persecution. And he said, when America became the first democratic nation, then the cause of America would become the cause of mankind. the cause of all humanity. And that's the America we're fighting for and America that will be a champion for democracy and human rights and freedom all over the world.",
