    "turn_text": "Dr. King and said, the arc of the moral of the universe is long, but it bends towards justice. And I suppose, there will be justice for us all. But far more important than justice in that individual case will be our ability to vindicate the rights of the people and defend democracy against Donald Trump. That's even more important than what happens to him.",
