    "turn_idx": 120,
    "turn_text": "And what do you tell those people who think that, you know, as a Trump supporter, that they're defending the rights of the people and that you're the fascist?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
