    "turn_idx": 122,
    "turn_text": "I can't tell you the number of people when I tell them I was there and I witnessed it for myself that I've been lied to with my own eyes. I was lied to. So I wish you luck in trying to get people to believe you because I've had very little luck at that.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
