    "turn_idx": 123,
    "turn_text": "Well, I appreciate where you're coming from. Obviously, all of this has been an education into the fragility of the human mind and how impressionable people are by con men and fascists and authoritarians. But our founders were enlightenment liberals who really thought that reason could govern and the positive passions could govern and not just hatred and fear and contempt. And so let's make sure that the American experiment continues to thrive.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
